            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 flex-1 flex flex-col">
            <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-primary text-center mb-3 h-14 flex items-center justify-center">Partners & Institutions</h3>
            <p class="text-foreground/70 text-sm text-center mb-4 flex-1">
              Funders, advisors, and aligned organizations.
            </p>
            <a 
              href="/tools" 
              class="flex justify-center items-center text-primary font-medium text-sm hover:underline mt-auto"
